BT /FB 21 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 773.89 Td (1. What you are actually hosting) Tj ET
0.8 G 0.6 w 56.0 765.89 m 539.28 765.89 l S
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 747.89 Td (CoBrain is not one app. It is a web tier and a worker tier that share a queue and a database, plus four data) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 734.89 Td (services. Most hosting mistakes come from treating it as a single Next.js app and discovering the second half later.) Tj ET
BT /FB 14 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 702.89 Td (The two halves) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 686.89 Td (Web tier \(Next.js\)) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 686.89 Td (UI, API routes, OAuth callbacks, RAG orchestration. Stateless -) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 674.89 Td (it holds nothing that cannot be rebuilt.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 659.89 Td (Worker tier \(Python\)) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 659.89 Td (ingest \(consumes the queue, embeds into Qdrant\), worker +) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 647.89 Td (beat \(Celery\), search-api \(vector retrieval\), forecast-api \(TFT\).) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 628.89 Td (The worker tier is not optional and not an add-on. The web tier only ever pushes onto Redis; if nothing consumes) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 615.89 Td (that queue, every upload and every connector sync succeeds, enqueues, and is never embedded. The app looks) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 602.89 Td (healthy while learning nothing.) Tj ET
BT /FB 14 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 570.89 Td (The four data services) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 554.89 Td (PostgreSQL \(business\)) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 554.89 Td (Workflows, connections, ingested items, brain blocks.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 539.89 Td (PostgreSQL \(auth\)) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 539.89 Td (Better Auth's own tables. Deliberately a separate database.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 524.89 Td (Redis) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 524.89 Td (The ingest queue. Web pushes, Python pops.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 509.89 Td (Qdrant) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 509.89 Td (Vector store. Written and read by Python only.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 494.89 Td (Object storage) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 494.89 Td (Uploaded documents and extracted images \(S3-compatible\).) Tj ET
BT /FR 8 Tf 0.55 g 479.28 42.0 Td (2 / 7) Tj ET
endstream
