BT /FB 21 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 773.89 Td (3. The order things must come up in) Tj ET
0.8 G 0.6 w 56.0 765.89 m 539.28 765.89 l S
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 747.89 Td (This is a dependency chain, not a checklist you can shuffle. Each step assumes the one above it is already) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 734.89 Td (answering.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 708.89 Td (1. DNS) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 694.89 Td (A records for cobrain.co and www -> the host. Do this first: TLS is issued on the first request, so a certificate) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 681.89 Td (cannot be obtained before the name resolves.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 655.89 Td (2. PostgreSQL \(both\)) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 641.89 Td (Business and auth databases reachable. Nothing else starts cleanly without them - /api/health returns 503 when) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 628.89 Td (Postgres is down, by design.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 602.89 Td (3. Migrations) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 588.89 Td (prisma migrate deploy runs to completion BEFORE the web tier starts. In compose this is the `migrate` service and) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 575.89 Td (the app waits on it. An app started against an older schema fails at the first query, not at boot.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 549.89 Td (4. Redis) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 535.89 Td (The queue must exist before either tier runs, or enqueues fail and syncs report success having stored nothing.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 509.89 Td (5. Qdrant + object storage) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 495.89 Td (The collection and the bucket. Workers create what they need on first use, but the endpoints have to answer.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 469.89 Td (6. Python workers) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 455.89 Td (search-api first \(the web tier's RAG calls it\), then ingest, worker, beat. Bring ingest up before opening the app to) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 442.89 Td (users, or the queue only grows.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 416.89 Td (7. Web tier) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 402.89 Td (Last. It depends on every one of the above. Point PYTHON_BACKEND_URL at search-api.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 376.89 Td (8. TLS / reverse proxy) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 362.89 Td (Caddy in front of the web tier. Only this process should publish ports.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 336.89 Td (9. Scheduler) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 322.89 Td (Celery beat pokes /api/cron/sync and /api/cron/extract every 5 minutes. If beat is not running, use an external) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 309.89 Td (pinger with the CRON_SECRET bearer token. Without this, connectors never refresh and uploads are never read.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 283.89 Td (10. OAuth registration) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 269.89 Td (Register every callback with each provider against the final domain. Do it last, because the URLs depend on the) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 256.89 Td (domain being settled.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8 Tf 0.55 g 479.28 42.0 Td (4 / 7) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
