BT /FB 21 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 773.89 Td (4. What to use for each piece) Tj ET
0.8 G 0.6 w 56.0 765.89 m 539.28 765.89 l S
BT /FB 14 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 731.89 Td (If you self-host \(A\)) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 715.89 Td (Host) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 715.89 Td (Hetzner CX32/CX42, DigitalOcean, or Linode. 4-8 GB RAM.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 700.89 Td (Everything else) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 700.89 Td (The bundled containers: Postgres, Redis, Qdrant, MinIO.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 685.89 Td (Auth database) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 685.89 Td (Neon, kept separate as the schema already assumes.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 670.89 Td (TLS) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 670.89 Td (Caddy - certificates are automatic and renewals need no cron.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 655.89 Td (Backups) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 655.89 Td (Nightly pg_dump plus a volume snapshot. Untested backups) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 643.89 Td (are not backups.) Tj ET
BT /FB 14 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 612.89 Td (If you split across managed services \(B or C\)) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 596.89 Td (Web tier) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 596.89 Td (Vercel, Railway, or Render.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 581.89 Td (Python tier) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 581.89 Td (Railway, Render, or Fly.io. Must be reachable over HTTPS.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 566.89 Td (PostgreSQL) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 566.89 Td (Neon or Supabase.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 551.89 Td (Redis) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 551.89 Td (Upstash - the existing ioredis client speaks its rediss:// endpoint.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 536.89 Td (Qdrant) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 536.89 Td (Qdrant Cloud. Set on the Python side only; the web tier never) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 524.89 Td (queries it.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 509.89 Td (Object storage) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 509.89 Td (Cloudflare R2 or S3. R2 has no egress fees.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 478.89 Td (The trap in this column) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 464.89 Td (In development every one of these points at localhost. On a split deployment localhost means the container itself,) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 451.89 Td (so REDIS_URL, PYTHON_BACKEND_URL and MINIO_ENDPOINT must all be changed. Miss one and the failure) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 438.89 Td (is partial: the app loads, sign-in works, and only chat or only uploads are broken.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8 Tf 0.55 g 479.28 42.0 Td (5 / 7) Tj ET
endstream
