BT /FB 21 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 773.89 Td (5. Failure modes worth knowing before they happen) Tj ET
0.8 G 0.6 w 56.0 765.89 m 539.28 765.89 l S
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 737.89 Td (The queue with no consumer) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 723.89 Td (Web tier up, ingest worker down. Uploads return 200, connectors report items synced, and nothing is ever) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 710.89 Td (embedded or answerable. Nothing errors. Check the queue depth on /brain/visualize, or LLEN) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 697.89 Td (company_brain:ingest.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 671.89 Td (Nothing pokes the cron) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 657.89 Td (Connectors only refresh when /api/cron/sync is called, and uploads are only read when /api/cron/extract is. On) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 644.89 Td (Vercel Hobby, crons run once a day, which is not a schedule this app can use. Beat or an external pinger is) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 631.89 Td (mandatory.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 605.89 Td (A localhost OAuth redirect in production) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 591.89 Td (The button works, the request leaves, and the user lands on the provider's error page. Nothing in this app logs it.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 578.89 Td (Redirects are now derived from APP_URL and the boot check refuses to start if one still points at localhost or plain) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 565.89 Td (http.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 539.89 Td (Migrations racing the app) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 525.89 Td (Start the web tier and the migration at once and the app serves requests against a schema mid-change. Compose) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 512.89 Td (orders this correctly; a manual deploy must too.) Tj ET
BT /FB 11 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 486.89 Td (The model bill) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 472.89 Td (Ingestion calls Claude per document. Roughly $0.17 for a 27-page PDF on Opus, about $0.03 on Haiku. Set a) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 459.89 Td (spend limit in the Anthropic console before connecting a large workspace, not after.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8 Tf 0.55 g 479.28 42.0 Td (6 / 7) Tj ET
endstream
