BT /FB 21 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 773.89 Td (6. Rough monthly cost) Tj ET
0.8 G 0.6 w 56.0 765.89 m 539.28 765.89 l S
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 747.89 Td (Excluding model usage, which is per-document and per-question.) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 727.89 Td (A. Single VPS) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 727.89 Td ($20-40 - one box, all services) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 712.89 Td (C. One PaaS) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 712.89 Td ($40-80 - managed, private networking, one vendor) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.1 g 56.0 697.89 Td (B. Fully split) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.25 g 268.97759999999994 697.89 Td ($60-120 - six vendors, most operational surface) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 676.89 Td (Model usage sits on top of all three and is the line most likely to surprise you. A demo is a few dollars; a large) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 56.0 663.89 Td (workspace ingested in one pass is not.) Tj ET
BT /FB 14 Tf 0.0 g 56.0 631.89 Td (Final checklist) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 615.89 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 70.0 615.89 Td (DNS resolves for the apex and www before the first deploy.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 600.89 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 70.0 600.89 Td (Migrations run to completion before the web tier starts.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 585.89 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 70.0 585.89 Td (The ingest worker is running - not just search-api.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 570.89 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 70.0 570.89 Td (Something pokes both /api/cron/* endpoints every few minutes.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 555.89 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 70.0 555.89 Td (No REDIS_URL, PYTHON_BACKEND_URL or MINIO_ENDPOINT still says localhost.) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.45 g 56.0 540.89 Td (-) Tj ET
